OL,3,GNEWSAMuch-loved community pub on track
OL,4,Ato reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA beloved 17th-century pub could reopen
OL,7,Fas early as next year after plans for
OL,8,Fits transformation were approved.
OL,10,FThe Ivy Inn in Heddington near Calne,
OL,11,FWiltshire, is owned by the Friends of
OL,12,Fthe Ivy group, after locals fought for
OL,13,Fit to become an asset of community
OL,14,Fvalue (ACV) following its closure in
OL,15,FMay 2024.
OL,17,FThe Grade II listed thatched pub has
OL,18,Fnow been granted Listed Building
OL,19,FConsent by Wiltshire Council for
OL,20,Fextensions and improvements designed to
OL,21,Fsecure its future as a community pub.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
